<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2001 bond yields 4.99 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2001 bond yields 4.99 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/94</p>
<p>bond was announced by the State Treasury Office:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-05-2001</p>
<p> COUPON:				 10.00 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			4.99 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION PRICE:			120.75</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,024 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 1,314 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>After this auction, the outstanding amount is 28,171 million markka.</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 1,714 million markka at a price of 120.90 and a yield of 5.05 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
